---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Base title="About" description="EVAN is a personal media brand by Evan Ratner — essays, guides, experiments, and tools on business, culture, markets, and technology.">

  <section class="article-header">
    <h1>About EVAN</h1>
    <p class="article-meta">By Evan Ratner</p>
  </section>

  <div class="article-body">
    <p>EVAN is a personal media brand. It started as RatLinks — a newsletter collecting the stories, links, and ideas worth paying attention to. Business, culture, markets, music, food, and everything in between.</p>

    <p>I'm Evan Ratner. I write about the things I'm thinking about, reading, and paying attention to. No niche, no formula — just the stuff that's actually interesting.</p>

    <h2>What You'll Find Here</h2>

    <p><strong><a href={`${base}/essays/`}>Essays</a></strong> — Analysis and opinion on business, culture, markets, and technology. The stories behind the headlines.</p>

    <p><strong><a href={`${base}/guides/`}>Guides</a></strong> — In-depth resources, playbooks, and how-to content on topics worth going deeper on.</p>

    <p><strong><a href={`${base}/experiments/`}>Experiments</a></strong> — Real experiments in media, business, and technology. What worked, what didn't, documented honestly.</p>

    <p><strong><a href={`${base}/tools/`}>Tools</a></strong> — Curated recommendations for tools, stacks, and resources I actually use.</p>

    <p><strong><a href={`${base}/ratlinks/`}>RatLinks Archive</a></strong> — The complete newsletter archive. 100+ editions of business, culture, markets, and everything in between.</p>

    <h2>The Newsletter</h2>

    <p>The EVAN Edit goes out weekly. Sharp takes on business, culture, markets, and the things worth paying attention to. <a href={`${base}/subscribe/`}>Subscribe here</a> or on <a href="https://ratlinks.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Substack</a>.</p>

    <h2>Get in Touch</h2>

    <p>Email: <a href="mailto:evan.ratner@gmail.com">evan.ratner@gmail.com</a></p>
    <p>Substack: <a href="https://ratlinks.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ratlinks.substack.com</a></p>
  </div>

</Base>
